## Overview
Performed full PostgreSQL database enumeration and extracted administrator credentials using UNION-based SQL Injection.

## Steps
- Enumerated tables
- Enumerated columns
- Extracted usernames and passwords

## Key Payload
' UNION SELECT NULL,username_pdeiol||':'||password_qgytwt FROM users_ohgyqx--

## Insight
SQL Injection vulnerabilities can lead to complete database disclosure and unauthorized administrative access.
